# Env files (fix, disclosed — was previously tracked; see PRODUCT_ANALYSIS_2026_09_13.md
# §6 item 8. VITE_-prefixed vars are compiled into the public client bundle so
# nothing secret was ever actually exposed by this, but env files still don't
# belong in version control — different machines/environments need different
# values, and this caused needless merge noise. .env.example stays tracked as
# the documented template.
.env
!.env.example

